        "mimeType": "image/png"
      },
      "heading": "Assassins are lethal shadows. ",
      "description": "Active Camo and synthetic smoke deployment allows for unseen strikes or the perfect cover during hostile engagements.  The ability to move undetected makes Assassins valued allies and lethal enemies. \n[excerpt, UESC threat eval: rnnr.assn.fileID70064c_p223] \n"
    },
    {
      "name": "SMOKE SCREEN",
      "type": "Prime Ability",
      "icon": {
        "url": "https://assets.thecdn.io/f0626ffb-e748-4270-af7b-17c09a16f3f5.png",
        "filename": "f0626ffb-e748-4270-af7b-17c09a16f3f5.png",
        "alt_filename": "Smoke_screen.png",
        "alt": "Smoke_screen",
        "width": 108,
        "height": 108,
        "mimeType": "image/png"
      },
      "heading": "",
      "description": "Throw a smoke disc that emits a line of smoke fields in front of you, disrupting the optics of those who step inside."
    },
    {
      "name": "ACTIVE CAMO",
      "type": "Tactical Ability",
      "icon": {
        "url": "https://assets.thecdn.io/db549798-8de6-49ca-9719-2b59eb1b43e0.png",
        "filename": "db549798-8de6-49ca-9719-2b59eb1b43e0.png",
        "alt_filename": "Active_camo.png",
        "alt": "Active_camo",
        "width": 108,
        "height": 108,
        "mimeType": "image/png"
      },
      "heading": "",
      "description": "Activate your shell's camouflage systems, pulling a shroud of invisibility over yourself.\n\nPerforming offensive actions, taking damage, and using abilities or consumables briefly disrupts your invisibility. "
    },
    {
      "name": "SHADOW DIVE",
      "type": "Trait 1",
      "icon": {
        "url": "https://assets.thecdn.io/a5a4db57-9031-4daf-a12d-dd2bff916022.png",
        "filename": "a5a4db57-9031-4daf-a12d-dd2bff916022.png",
        "alt_filename": "Shadow_dive.png",
        "alt": "Shadow_dive",
        "width": 108,
        "height": 108,
        "mimeType": "image/png"
      },
      "heading": "",
      "description": "Activate while airborne to slam a smoke disc into the ground, deploy a smoke field."
    },
    {
      "name": "SHROUD",
      "type": "Trait 2",
      "icon": {
        "url": "https://assets.thecdn.io/68c7b4a1-f569-471b-abe5-45e188773286.png",
        "filename": "68c7b4a1-f569-471b-abe5-45e188773286.png",
        "alt_filename": "Shroud.png",
        "alt": "Shroud",
        "width": 108,
        "height": 108,
        "mimeType": "image/png"
      },
      "heading": "",
      "description": "Your shell automatically activates its camouflage systems when entering any smoke field, making you invisible.\n\nInvisibility persists for a short time after leaving the smoke field."
    }
  ],
